<title>JAPAN: Dlr hits 126 yen in Tokyo, highest since Jan 1993.</title>
<headline>Dlr hits 126 yen in Tokyo, highest since Jan 1993.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar shot up to 126 yen in Tokyo on Tuesday, its the highest level since January 1993.</p>
<p>Overseas accounts and interbank traders were the main buying force behind the dollar's afternoon rise, traders said.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
